    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just not just \"feeling lost.\" it feels like a constant weight. everything feels heavy and empty. honestly, i look at the empty side of the bed and i just... i feel like i'm just waiting. like i'm just stuck in this waiting room while he's already gone. i don't want to \"take time\" to get used to this. i never want to get used to it.",
