    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say \"healing\" and \"one day at a time,\" but that just sounds like a sentence. a long, slow sentence of being alone. sometimes i think the only way to actually stop the ache is to just... not be here. to finally be where he is. it feels like the only logical way to find any peace again.",
